  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Primary path",
      "items": [
        "Officer opens a flagged account; the workflow gathers evidence, scores it, retrieves clauses and drafts",
        "A draft failing verification goes back to the LLM once, then is flagged to the officer",
        "The case pauses for the officer, customer and police; the SQLite checkpoint lets it resume days later"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust boundaries",
      "items": [
        "Rules, not the LLM, set the hold level; the prompt forbids changing it and the verifier checks it",
        "Evidence and clause text leave the machine for Groq over HTTPS; synthetic data only",
        "Customer documents are also checked for any mention of an STR or FIU-IND",
        "Groq key from .env, kept out of git; the officer approves every action"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Also in the code",
      "items": [
        "Streamlit reads the MIS log and Neo4j directly for the queue and the graph view",
        "documents.py runs the same verifier on notices, police reference and STR",
        "SOP clock (clock.py) turns case dates into the 20, 10, 30 and 60-day deadlines"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Build-time dependencies",
      "items": [
        "Kaggle IBM AML data, loaded into Neo4j by ingest, features and graph_store",
        "rbi.org.in pages split into clauses by corpus.py",
        "Hugging Face bge-small embeddings, cached locally after first use"
      ]
    }
  ]
